@host = http://localhost:5247
@edition = anniversary
@specSlug = retribution-paladin
@bossSlug = illidan-stormrage
@zoneId = 1060
@encounterId = 50609
@className = Paladin
@specName = Retribution

# These requests call the application API. Live rankings require WCL credentials.
# GET spec/{specSlug}/{bossSlug} and its /info variant share all query parameters.
# Required context: nonblank edition, zoneId > 0, className, specName, explicit metric.
# encounterId is optional; the service resolves an omitted encounter using static/upstream data.
# Defaults: refresh=false, difficulty=mythic, includeCombatantInfo=false, includeOtherPlayers=true.
# difficulty accepts lfr, normal, heroic, mythic; difficultyId explicitly overrides it.
# Optional: page, partition, bracket, size (raid size, NOT result count),
# serverRegion, serverSlug, filter, hardModeLevel, externalBuffs.
# hardModeLevel: Any, Highest, NormalMode, Level0-Level4 (aliases are also accepted).
# externalBuffs: Any, Require, Exclude (aliases are also accepted).
# The service always requests combatant metadata for faction enrichment.
# GET responses: 200, 400, 404, 429, 500; error bodies contain "error".
# Complete cached timelines are bundled without downloading uncached player events.
# PATCH spec/dirty accepts the same context/options except refresh, plus dirty=true.
# It acknowledges refresh state; it does not fetch rankings or persist a dirty flag.
# Both POST queue routes are placeholders, not running background jobs.
# Their taskId is not trackable: no task-status endpoint is implemented.

### Full rankings and complete cached timelines
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/spec/{{specSlug}}/{{bossSlug}}?edition={{edition}}&zoneId={{zoneId}}&encounterId={{encounterId}}&className={{className}}&specName={{specName}}&difficulty=normal&metric=dps
Accept: application/json

### Info-only rankings; reports are omitted from the returned collection
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/spec/{{specSlug}}/{{bossSlug}}/info?edition={{edition}}&zoneId={{zoneId}}&encounterId={{encounterId}}&className={{className}}&specName={{specName}}&difficulty=normal&metric=dps
Accept: application/json

### All supported GET query parameters
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/spec/{{specSlug}}/{{bossSlug}}?edition={{edition}}&refresh=false&difficulty=normal&metric=dps&zoneId={{zoneId}}&encounterId={{encounterId}}&className={{className}}&specName={{specName}}&difficultyId=3&page=1&partition=1&bracket=1&size=25&serverRegion=US&serverSlug=area-52&filter=&hardModeLevel=Any&externalBuffs=Exclude&includeCombatantInfo=true&includeOtherPlayers=true
Accept: application/json

### Info variant with every supported GET query parameter
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/spec/{{specSlug}}/{{bossSlug}}/info?edition={{edition}}&refresh=false&difficulty=normal&metric=dps&zoneId={{zoneId}}&encounterId={{encounterId}}&className={{className}}&specName={{specName}}&difficultyId=3&page=1&partition=1&bracket=1&size=25&serverRegion=US&serverSlug=area-52&filter=&hardModeLevel=Any&externalBuffs=Exclude&includeCombatantInfo=false&includeOtherPlayers=false
Accept: application/json

### Explicitly bypass upstream response cache
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/spec/{{specSlug}}/{{bossSlug}}?edition={{edition}}&zoneId={{zoneId}}&encounterId={{encounterId}}&className={{className}}&specName={{specName}}&difficulty=normal&metric=dps&refresh=true
Accept: application/json

### Refresh acknowledgement with every supported PATCH parameter
PATCH {{host}}/api/rankings/spec/dirty?specSlug={{specSlug}}&bossSlug={{bossSlug}}&edition={{edition}}&difficulty=normal&metric=dps&zoneId={{zoneId}}&encounterId={{encounterId}}&className={{className}}&specName={{specName}}&difficultyId=3&page=1&partition=1&bracket=1&size=25&serverRegion=US&serverSlug=area-52&filter=&hardModeLevel=Any&externalBuffs=Exclude&includeCombatantInfo=false&includeOtherPlayers=true&dirty=true
Accept: application/json

### Clean acknowledgement
PATCH {{host}}/api/rankings/spec/dirty?specSlug={{specSlug}}&bossSlug={{bossSlug}}&edition={{edition}}&zoneId={{zoneId}}&className={{className}}&specName={{specName}}&difficulty=normal&metric=dps&dirty=false
Accept: application/json

### Spec queue placeholder defaults: all/all/all/all, limit=50, clear=false
POST {{host}}/api/rankings/spec/queue
Accept: application/json

### Spec queue placeholder with all supported parameters
POST {{host}}/api/rankings/spec/queue?specSlug={{specSlug}}&bossSlug={{bossSlug}}&difficulty=normal&metric=dps&limit=10&clear=true
Accept: application/json

### Composition queue placeholder defaults: bossSlug=all, limit=50, clear=false
POST {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/queue
Accept: application/json

### Composition queue placeholder with all supported parameters
POST {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/queue?bossSlug={{bossSlug}}&limit=10&clear=true
Accept: application/json

### Missing required context: 400 without an upstream call
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/spec/{{specSlug}}/{{bossSlug}}
Accept: application/json

### Invalid metric: 400
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/spec/{{specSlug}}/{{bossSlug}}/info?edition={{edition}}&zoneId={{zoneId}}&className={{className}}&specName={{specName}}&metric=unsupported
Accept: application/json

### Invalid page: 400
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/spec/{{specSlug}}/{{bossSlug}}?edition={{edition}}&zoneId={{zoneId}}&className={{className}}&specName={{specName}}&metric=dps&page=0
Accept: application/json

### Missing PATCH context: 400
PATCH {{host}}/api/rankings/spec/dirty
Accept: application/json
